  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Bai Qing recognizes the immemorial desolate beast myriad eyes clear bull when it surfaces from Falling Heavenly River. It is a riverbed overlord that normally stays below and patrols its territory.",
      "chapters": [
        955
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-at-the-river",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_qing",
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recovers a myriad eyes clear bull head from Falling Heavenly River. Of the bull’s parts, the eyes are the most valuable. The two eyes are dark and deep, full of dark path dao marks. When he obtains them, many dark path wild mortal Gu are still inside, mostly rank five, unable to escape in time.",
      "chapters": [
        994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dark-path-eyes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The eyes of the myriad eyes clear bull cannot see; they are blind to begin with. The beast perceives vision through eye tattoos on its thick skin, not through these eyeballs.",
      "chapters": [
        994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
